OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog slowly lifting through the
OL,6,Fmorning, though some patches may
OL,7,Flinger into early afternoon across
OL,8,Fparts of central England and Wales.
OL,9,FOtherwise, largely dry with sunny
OL,10,Fspells for many. Showers near eastern
OL,11,Fcoasts will gradually fade. Feeling
OL,12,Fchilly.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClearer skies across central
OL,15,Fand northern areas will allow fog
OL,16,Fpatches and a rural frost to develop.
OL,17,FCloudier, breezier and milder
OL,18,Fconditions spread across southern
OL,19,Fparts with rain arriving.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
