OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloud and rain gradually push
OL,6,Fnorth across parts of England and
OL,7,FWales, locally heavy in the southwest
OL,8,Flater. Elsewhere, many areas stay dry
OL,9,Fwith bright spells after slow clearing
OL,10,Ffog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
